  "description": "Addition of proposals to existing approved scheme for: Amalgamation of lower ground floor flat and first, second and third floor maisonette into a single self-contained unit. Mansard roof extension. Single storey lower ground extension. Modifications and increasing height of existing rear extension and railings including new first floor balcony area. Replacement of all existing sash windows with heritage double glazed sash windows. Additional proposals to include: Reinstatement of external decorative brackets to the first floor balcony. Replacement of first floor front balcony railings. Addition of security bars to front lightwell window. Installation of 8 no. solar panels on the roof. Installation of 2 no. air source heat pump units to the roof. ",
